// Command & Conquer: Generals Zero Hour -- Simplified Chinese game text
//
// Plain UTF-8. One entry is a label line, a quoted string, and END.
// Lines starting with // are comments. Escapes: \n \t \" \\
//
// Translated from the English original (EnglishZH.big, generals.csf), using the names the
// Chinese-speaking community uses for the game (GLA, 指挥中心, 飞毛腿风暴, 粒子加农炮, 黑莲花,
// 霸王坦克, 皇帝坦克, ...). Hotkeys follow the Chinese convention "名称(&K)". Multiplayer map
// names stay in English. Includes legacy labels for older game data.
// Checked with scripts/language/translate_kit.py. See languages/README.md before editing.

